With a very simple stratagem, even with no starting equipment, you can
get unlimited wishes and get all the gold or gems you want, get the
Amulet, and kill the wizard, all without leaving the up stairs on level 1!
And then the endgame is a breeze.  Just... (*spoiler*)

Get early nethack 3.0 sources, compile it yourself, and play in Debug
mode!

Use the debugging commands to wish up the Amulet and create the
Wizard.  Better wish for some dragon scale mail and Stormbringer while
you're at it.  Kill wizard.  Go upstairs and teleport across the
level.  Wish up tons o' gold and gems.  Ascend.  Bask in the illusion
of accomplishment.

Easy!  Unfortunately, the development team is on to this trick, so it
may not work in later releases... :-)


